{"response":{"docs":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03541001","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03541001","description":["Stalks/canes/trunk sap used as source of sugar from the plant classified under the species Saccharum officinarum L., commonly known as Sugar canes or Sugar cane molasses or Sugar cane fodder or Sugar cane forage. The part consumed/analysed is not specified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors. In case of data collections related to legislations, the default part consumed/analysed is the one defined in the applicable legislation.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sugarcane] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm\u003disch\u0026q\u003dSugar canes]"],"label":"10010 - sugar canes (efsa foodex2)","obo_id":"FOODON:03541001","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003444","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_00003444","description":["A stem of a sugar cane plant (Saccharum officinarum)."],"label":"sugar cane stem","obo_id":"FOODON:00003444","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["sugar cane"]},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03542990","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03542990","description":["The group includes any type of Brown cane sugar (sucrose). The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brown_sugar] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm\u003disch\u0026q\u003dBrown cane sugar]"],"label":"29900 - brown cane sugar (efsa foodex2)","obo_id":"FOODON:03542990","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03542987","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03542987","description":["The group includes any type of refined cane sugar (sucrose). The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/White_sugar] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm\u003disch\u0026q\u003dRefined cane sugar]"],"label":"29870 - refined cane sugar (efsa foodex2)","obo_id":"FOODON:03542987","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03301879","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03301879","description":["A raw (unrefined) sugar cane stem.","SIREN DB annotation:\n* whole, natural shape FOODON:03430150\n* not heat-treated FOODON:03440003\n* stem or stalk (without leaves) FOODON:03420101"],"label":"sugar cane stem (raw)","obo_id":"FOODON:03301879","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03541000","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03541000","description":["The group includes Sugar canes or similar canes sharing the same pesticide MRL, as defined by EU pesticide regulation. ] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sugarcane] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm\u003disch\u0026q\u003dSugar canes and similar-]"],"label":"10000 - sugar canes and similar- (efsa foodex2)","obo_id":"FOODON:03541000","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401879","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03401879","description":["Includes any product that can be described/observed as a fresh commercial variety of Sugar Cane, grown from Saccharum officinarum, to be supplied fresh. \nSpecifically excludes: Prepared/Processed or Unprepared/Unprocessed and Shelf Stable or Frozen Sugar","LanguaL curation note: Index geographical origin in facet R,  growing method (conventional, organic) in facet Z."],"label":"10006371 - sugar cane (gs1 gpc)","obo_id":"FOODON:03401879","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03543004","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03543004","description":["The group includes any type of molasses obtained from Sugar cane. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Molasses] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm\u003disch\u0026q\u003dSugar cane molasses]"],"label":"30040 - sugar cane molasses (efsa foodex2)","obo_id":"FOODON:03543004","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03311346","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03311346","description":["SIREN DB annotation:\n* liquid, high viscosity, with no visible particles FOODON:03430139\n* sugar syrup or syrup solids FOODON:03420271"],"label":"sugar cane syrup","obo_id":"FOODON:03311346","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00001004","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_00001004","description":["This food product type includes food products which are made from fermentation of juice extracted from pressed sugarcane."],"label":"fermenting sugar cane juice","obo_id":"FOODON:00001004","type":"class"}],"numFound":38,"start":0},"responseHeader":{"QTime":0,"status":0},"facet_counts":{"facet_fields":{"ontologyPreferredPrefix":["FOODON","38"],"isDefiningOntology":["true","35","false","3"],"ontologyId":["foodon","38","tfo","9","ncbitaxon","7","mesh","5","snomed","5","maxo","5","lifestylefactors","5","envo","4","micro","4","medgen","4","chebi","3","slm","2","enm","2","pride","2","efo","2","valuesets","1","cco","1","vo","1","cdno","1","doid","1","dron","1","fobi","1","fypo","1","gaz","1","gexo","1","go","1","mco","1","peco","1","pso","1","reto","1","rexo","1","to","1"],"ontologyIri":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/foodon.owl","38"],"isObsolete":["false","38","true","4"],"type":["class","38"]}}}